# Fold labels

:lemma: {:label: lem-fold} A statement to prove. ::

:sketch:

  The idea in one line.

::

:proof: {
  :of: lem-fold
  :collapsed:
}

  :step: {:label: stp-sub}

    A step with sub-steps.

    :step: {:label: stp-sub-a} First sub-step. ::

    :step: {:label: stp-sub-b} Second sub-step. ::

  ::

  :step: {:label: stp-just}

    A claim with a reason.

    :p: The reason. ::

  ::

  :step: {:label: stp-bare} A bare claim. ::

::

:proof: {:label: prf-open}

  :step: A step in an open proof. ::

::

:proof:

  :calc:

    :step: $f(x) = a$

      :p: Because of the first reason. ::

    ::

  ::

::
